<h1 data-copy-en="Zodiac" data-copy-zh="Zodiac">Zodiac</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Zodiac’s Syndicate progression, personal conversations, Spirit Communication and daily actions." data-copy-zh="Zodiac的辛迪加进展、个人谈心、灵体沟通与日常互动。">Zodiac’s Syndicate progression, personal conversations, Spirit Communication and daily actions.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find Zodiac</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">Missing actions and useful checks</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">出现地点与时间</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">动作缺失时的检查</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Credits_and_Current_Scope"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Repeatable_Private_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Syndicate_Jobs_and_Automatic_Events"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Closer"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="A_Fair_Game"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Two_Personal_Conversations"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Talk_and_Spirit_Communication"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Zodiac — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/zodiac.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Zodiac — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/zodiac.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Zodiac — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Zodiac’s route combines the Syndicate mission sequence and personal relationship milestones. Her two heart-to-hearts have independent stage gates; ordinary Talk starts later than her first introduction.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview_and_Schedule"></span><h2>Where to find Zodiac</h2><p>Find her all day at Fortune Teller's Booth, reached from the Syndicate Gates or Big Top in the Future Prime Sector. Entering the booth starts her introduction once.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Location</th><th scope="col">Portrait schedule</th><th scope="col">Condition</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Fortune Teller's Booth</th><td data-label="Portrait schedule">all day</td><td data-label="Condition"></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Windows refer to the time you start an action; the ending time is excluded.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Progress the gatekeeper and the three introductions before Collecting Dues. The following bar encounter uses Robot Bar; New Blood leads to the shared transport-hub mission. Later reconnaissance requires Rogue 50 after the preceding Syndicate planning milestone.</p><p>Personal meetings include an evening Den encounter at Known (25), then Friend (100), Close Friend (200) and Crush (400) milestones at the booth. Some later scenes also need the Syndicate mission chain. A Fair Game requires Friend; Closer requires Crush, without requiring A Fair Game first.</p><details><summary>Automatic encounters: complete start conditions</summary><p>Enter the indicated location during its scene window. These encounters complete once; fixed base relationship rewards below are separate from choice bonuses. A missing hour restriction means the scene itself has no extra clock gate.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Encounter</th><th scope="col">Start location / hours</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Fixed base relationship</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">The Foretold Meeting</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Fortune Teller's Booth; any hour</td><td data-label="Requirements"></td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Zodiac +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Collecting Dues</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Fortune Teller's Booth; any hour</td><td data-label="Requirements">after The Foretold Meeting / Fresh Meat / Send in the Clown / The Gatekeeper</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Zodiac +3 / Poison +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Collecting Dues - The Bar</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Synthetic Beings Recharge Station; any hour</td><td data-label="Requirements">after Collecting Dues</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Zodiac +2 / Poison +2</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">New Blood</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Fortune Teller's Booth; any hour</td><td data-label="Requirements">after Collecting Dues - The Bar</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Zodiac +3 / Kitty +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Open Doors</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Fortune Teller's Booth; any hour</td><td data-label="Requirements">after Lines on the Board; Rogue 50</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Zodiac +5 / Kitty +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">What the Cards Don't Show</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">The Den; 18:00–24:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Zodiac Known (25)</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Zodiac +1</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Dead Ends</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Fortune Teller's Booth; any hour</td><td data-label="Requirements">Zodiac Friend (100)</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Zodiac +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Cards on the Table</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Fortune Teller's Booth; any hour</td><td data-label="Requirements">Zodiac Close Friend (200); after Dead Ends</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Zodiac +15</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Necessary Evil</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Fortune Teller's Booth; any hour</td><td data-label="Requirements">Zodiac Close Friend (200); after The Honeypot</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Zodiac +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Confession</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Fortune Teller's Booth; any hour</td><td data-label="Requirements">Zodiac Crush (400); after The Necessary Evil</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Zodiac +15</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Behind the Curtain</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Fortune Teller's Booth; any hour</td><td data-label="Requirements">after The Reckoning</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Zodiac +20 / Motley +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The New Variable</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">The Parlor; any hour</td><td data-label="Requirements"></td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Kitty +7 / Zodiac +7 / Chamel +7</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Taming the Rookie</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Prime Transportation Nexus Hub; 07:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">after New Blood</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Kitty +3 / Zodiac +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Lines on the Board</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">The Parlor; any hour</td><td data-label="Requirements">after Cat's Eyes / Street Knowledge / The Boss Takes Notice</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Motley +3 / Zodiac +3 / Kitty +2 / Poison +2 / Chamel +3 / Bayne +4</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Invisible</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Synergy Corp Corporate Tower; any hour</td><td data-label="Requirements">after Open Doors</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Kitty +5 / Zodiac +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Honeypot</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Motley's Lair; any hour</td><td data-label="Requirements">after Invisible; Rogue 55</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Motley +5 / Zodiac +5 / Kitty +5 / Chamel +5 / Poison +5 / Bayne +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">No Plan Survives</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">The Parlor; any hour</td><td data-label="Requirements">after The Honeypot / Faces</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Bayne +6 / Kitty +2 / Poison +2 / Zodiac +1 / Chamel +2 / Chamella +2</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Weight of a Secret</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">The Parlor; any hour</td><td data-label="Requirements">after The Punchline</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Motley +5 / Zodiac +4 / Chamel +3 / Chamella +2</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Second Knock</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Syndicate Gates; any hour</td><td data-label="Requirements">after The Weight of a Secret / Badge and Bluster</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Bayne +7 / Kitty +3 / Poison +3 / Zodiac +3 / Motley +1</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Reckoning</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Motley's Lair; any hour</td><td data-label="Requirements">Motley Friend (100); after The Confession / The Game</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Motley +15 / Zodiac +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Not for Free</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">The Parlor; any hour</td><td data-label="Requirements">after Room for Reinforcements</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Motley +7 / Zodiac +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Long Way Out</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">The Funhouse; any hour</td><td data-label="Requirements">after The Third Knock</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Motley +5 / Zodiac +4 / Chamel +5 / Kitty +3 / Poison +3 / Bayne +2</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Our War</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">The Parlor; any hour</td><td data-label="Requirements">after What She Built</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Motley +10 / Ghost +5 / Kitty +5 / Zodiac +5 / Chamel +5 / Poison +5 / Bayne +5</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details></section>
<section id="en-activities"><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><p>Talk costs 15 minutes, gives 1 actual base point, and allows five safe uses daily at Acquaintance (50). Use the introduction and shared scenes to build the relationship before that button opens.</p><p>Spirit Communication requires Friend (100), Mystic 18 and an unlearned skill, costing 180 minutes, $300, 45 Energy and 40 Calm with the corresponding content access. The two optional private animations have separate daily uses at 1,000 and 1,500 relationship points.</p><p>Relationship rewards are base values unless marked direct. Shared relationship modifiers affect the final gain. Repeated actions keep their daily allowance when you meet the same character elsewhere.</p><details><summary>Relationship bonuses</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Type</th><th scope="col">Reference</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Favorite stats</th><td data-label="Reference">Mystic 90 / Perception 85 / Intelligence 85</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Relationship skill</th><td data-label="Reference">Divination</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Favorite-stat contribution scales toward the listed values. The relationship skill affects the shared relationship multiplier; it is not automatically a skill taught by this character.</p></details><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Result / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Fortune Teller's Booth; all day</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acquaintance (50)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">15 min</td><td data-label="Result / limit">base relationship +1; 5 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Spirit Communication</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Fortune Teller's Booth; all day</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100); Mystic 18; corresponding content access</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">180 min; $300; −45 Energy; −40 Calm</td><td data-label="Result / limit">learn Spirit Communication; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Intimate with Zodiac</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Fortune Teller's Booth; all day</td><td data-label="Requirements">relationship 1000</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">30 min; −20 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">base relationship +80; 1 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Intimate with Zodiac II</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Fortune Teller's Booth; all day</td><td data-label="Requirements">relationship 1500</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">30 min; −20 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">base relationship +120; 1 safe uses/day</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Troubleshooting"></span><h2>Missing actions and useful checks</h2><p>Missing Talk at Stranger is expected. Clout and the player’s Rogue stat are different requirements. The favored Divination skill improves relationship rewards if learned; her actual lesson is Spirit Communication.</p></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><p><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Relationships, dates and intimacy</a> · <a href="character-kitty.html">Kitty</a> · <a href="character-marcus.html">Marcus</a></p></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Credits_and_Current_Scope"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Repeatable_Private_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Syndicate_Jobs_and_Automatic_Events"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Closer"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-A_Fair_Game"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Two_Personal_Conversations"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Talk_and_Spirit_Communication"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Zodiac 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/zodiac.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Zodiac 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/zodiac.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Zodiac 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Zodiac的路线结合辛迪加任务与个人关系里程碑。两段谈心分别检查自己的阶段，普通交谈则不会在初见时就立即开放。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview_and_Schedule"></span><h2>出现地点与时间</h2><p>她全天在占卜摊位，可从未来核心区的辛迪加大门或大帐篷进入。首次进入可触发初见事件。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">地点</th><th scope="col">头像出现时间</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">占卜摊位</th><td data-label="头像出现时间">全天</td><td data-label="条件"></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>时段按开始动作时判定，结束时间不包含在内。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>先完成守门人和三人的初见，再推进收取债务；之后的酒吧阶段在机器人酒吧，新血接向交通枢纽共同任务。后期侦察还要求完成前一项辛迪加筹划事件，并达到盗贼50。</p><p>个人会面包括已知（25）阶段晚间的巢穴事件，以及占卜摊位朋友（100）、亲密朋友（200）、迷恋（400）的里程碑，部分后续事件也需要辛迪加任务进展。公平对局要求朋友，更近一步要求迷恋，但不必先完成公平对局。</p><details><summary>展开自动事件的完整开始条件</summary><p>在事件时段进入指定地点即可触发。均为一次性事件，下列固定基础关系奖励与选择奖励另算；未列额外时段表示事件本身不再加设时间限制。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">事件</th><th scope="col">开始地点／时间</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">固定基础关系奖励</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">预言中的相遇</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">占卜摊位; 不限时段</td><td data-label="条件"></td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Zodiac +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">收取保护费</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">占卜摊位; 不限时段</td><td data-label="条件">完成：预言中的相遇、新鲜血液、小丑登场、守门人</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Zodiac +3、Poison +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">收取保护费 - 酒吧</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">机器人酒吧; 不限时段</td><td data-label="条件">完成：收取保护费</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Zodiac +2、Poison +2</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">新血</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">占卜摊位; 不限时段</td><td data-label="条件">完成：收取保护费 - 酒吧</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Zodiac +3、Kitty +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">敞开大门</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">占卜摊位; 不限时段</td><td data-label="条件">完成：板上的线索；盗贼 50</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Zodiac +5、Kitty +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">牌面之外</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">巢穴; 18:00–24:00</td><td data-label="条件">Zodiac 已知（25）</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Zodiac +1</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">死路</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">占卜摊位; 不限时段</td><td data-label="条件">Zodiac 朋友（100）</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Zodiac +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">摊牌</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">占卜摊位; 不限时段</td><td data-label="条件">Zodiac 亲密朋友（200）；完成：死路</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Zodiac +15</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">必要之恶</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">占卜摊位; 不限时段</td><td data-label="条件">Zodiac 亲密朋友（200）；完成：美人计</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Zodiac +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">告白</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">占卜摊位; 不限时段</td><td data-label="条件">Zodiac 迷恋（400）；完成：必要之恶</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Zodiac +15</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">帷幕后方</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">占卜摊位; 不限时段</td><td data-label="条件">完成：清算</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Zodiac +20、Motley +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">新变量</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">会客厅; 不限时段</td><td data-label="条件"></td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Kitty +7、Zodiac +7、Chamel +7</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">驯服菜鸟</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">核心区交通枢纽; 07:00–17:00</td><td data-label="条件">完成：新血</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Kitty +3、Zodiac +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">板上的线索</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">会客厅; 不限时段</td><td data-label="条件">完成：猫眼、街头情报、老大注意到了你</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Motley +3、Zodiac +3、Kitty +2、Poison +2、Chamel +3、Bayne +4</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">隐形</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">新能集公司企业塔; 不限时段</td><td data-label="条件">完成：敞开大门</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Kitty +5、Zodiac +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">美人计</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">Motley的巢穴; 不限时段</td><td data-label="条件">完成：隐形；盗贼 55</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Motley +5、Zodiac +5、Kitty +5、Chamel +5、Poison +5、Bayne +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">计划终成泡影</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">会客厅; 不限时段</td><td data-label="条件">完成：美人计、千面</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Bayne +6、Kitty +2、Poison +2、Zodiac +1、Chamel +2、Chamella +2</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">秘密的重量</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">会客厅; 不限时段</td><td data-label="条件">完成：包袱</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Motley +5、Zodiac +4、Chamel +3、Chamella +2</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">第二次敲门</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">辛迪加大门; 不限时段</td><td data-label="条件">完成：秘密的重量、徽章与虚张声势</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Bayne +7、Kitty +3、Poison +3、Zodiac +3、Motley +1</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">清算</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">Motley的巢穴; 不限时段</td><td data-label="条件">Motley 朋友（100）；完成：告白、游戏</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Motley +15、Zodiac +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">不是白帮忙</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">会客厅; 不限时段</td><td data-label="条件">完成：为援军留个位置</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Motley +7、Zodiac +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">绕远路脱身</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">欢乐屋; 不限时段</td><td data-label="条件">完成：第三次敲门</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Motley +5、Zodiac +4、Chamel +5、Kitty +3、Poison +3、Bayne +2</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">我们的战争</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">会客厅; 不限时段</td><td data-label="条件">完成：她亲手建立的</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Motley +10、Ghost +5、Kitty +5、Zodiac +5、Chamel +5、Poison +5、Bayne +5</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><h2>行动与奖励</h2><p>普通交谈要求相识（50），消耗15分钟，实际给予1点基础关系，每日安全额度5次。按钮开放前，可以靠初见与共同事件培养关系。</p><p>灵体沟通教学要求朋友（100）、神秘18和尚未学会该技能，消耗180分钟、300财富、45精力、40镇定，并需要相应内容访问权限。两项可选私人动画分别在1,000、1,500点关系开放，每项有独立每日额度。</p><p>除注明直接增加外，关系奖励均为基础值，最终增量受共通关系修正影响。同一角色换地点不会重置重复动作的每日额度。</p><details><summary>展开关系加成参考</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">类别</th><th scope="col">参考</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">偏好属性</th><td data-label="参考">神秘 90、感知 85、智力 85</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">关系加成技能</th><td data-label="参考">占卜</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>偏好属性的加成随数值提高，逐步达到所列参考值。关系加成技能影响共通关系倍率，不代表该角色一定负责教授这项技能。</p></details><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">动作</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">结果／限制</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">交谈</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">占卜摊位; 全天</td><td data-label="条件">相识（50）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">15分钟</td><td data-label="结果／限制">基础关系+1；5次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">灵体沟通</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">占卜摊位; 全天</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100）；神秘18；相应内容访问权限</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">180分钟；财富300；−45 精力；−40 镇定</td><td data-label="结果／限制">学会灵体沟通；1次／日安全额度；一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">与 Zodiac 亲密相处</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">占卜摊位; 全天</td><td data-label="条件">关系点数1000</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">30分钟；−20 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">基础关系+80；1次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">与 Zodiac 亲密相处 II</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">占卜摊位; 全天</td><td data-label="条件">关系点数1500</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">30分钟；−20 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">基础关系+120；1次／日安全额度</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Troubleshooting"></span><h2>动作缺失时的检查</h2><p>陌生人阶段没有普通交谈是正常情况。派系声望与玩家盗贼属性是不同要求。偏好技能占卜在已学会时提高关系奖励，她实际教授的技能则是灵体沟通。</p></section>
<section id="zh-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Related_Pages"></span><h2>相关指南</h2><p><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">关系、约会与亲密互动</a> · <a href="character-kitty.html">Kitty</a> · <a href="character-marcus.html">Marcus</a></p></section>
